  dcterms:description "A dataset of 943 historical and modern shipwreck events, each describing the vessel name, operator (country or naval force), year lost, cause of loss, vessel type, and the geographic coordinates of the wreck site. FAIRified from the original Kaggle dataset 'Shipwrecks (Sunk ships)' by Group 26 for the FAIR Data Engineering course (University of Twente, 2026).";
